Perlich, Grace Zabriskie, and William S.

15
01:03:45,000 --> 01:03:51,000
Based on the then-unpublished novel of the same name by James Fogle, it
follows a group of nomadic drug addicts in 1971 Portland, Oregon.

16
01:08:00,000 --> 01:08:06,000
It was Van Sant's second film as director, following his 1988 debut Mala Noche.

17
01:12:15,000 --> 01:12:21,000
Principal photography of Drugstore Cowboy took
place in Portland in the fall of 1988.

18
01:16:30,000 --> 01:16:36,000
